  "notes": "Electrical and optical characteristics are at EOL, TOP = 0 to 70 °C, VCC = 3.135 to 3.465 V. Limited-temp variant: case 20°C to +60°C, power dissipation <10 W; c-temp: 0°C to +70°C, <12 W (also Module total power max 10 W limited temp, 12 W c-temp). Average launch power min (-2 dBm) and average receive power min (-8.3 dBm) are informative. Receiver sensitivity -6.1 dBm (OMAouter, max) for SECQ 3.4 dB; stressed receiver sensitivity -4.1 dBm (OMAouter) with SECQ 3.4 dB test conditions. Signaling rate optical 53.125 ± 100 ppm GBd per lane; electrical 26.5625 ± 100 ppm Gbd per lane. Maximum distance SMF per G.652 Lmax1 10,000 m. BER max 2.4E-4 as defined by IEEE P802.3bs. Receiver damage threshold 5.8 dBm per lane; absolute max receiver damage 5 dBm per lane.",
